{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16604","headline":"七贤庙 · 朱湾","name":"七贤庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常慕晋高士，放心日沈冥。\n湛然对一壶，土木爲我形。\n下马访陈迹，披榛诣荒庭。\n相看两不言，犹谓醉未醒。\n长啸或可拟，幽琴难再听。\n同心不共世，空见藓门青。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱湾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16604.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16604","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}